<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/adler32> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Adler-32 checksum is part of the widely used zlib compression library as defined in [RFC 1950](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc1950/) Section 2.3."@en .
